<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 700 mln tenge bills May 12.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 700 mln tenge bills May 12.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 700 million tenge ($9.3 million) of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills on May 12, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ46K1311971</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   700 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     May 12, 1997</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Nov 13, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410 ($ = 75.42 Kazakhstan Tenge)</p>
